      },
      ["opening"] = {
        { "I began again {at}, hoping to come a little nearer to the arcane lore our ancestors had left behind in Eldre'Thalas.", tags = { "faction:alliance" } },
        { "I kept going {at}, as the High Order would have it: on my own strength, and by no one else's leave.", tags = { "faction:alliance" } },
        { "I set out {at}, wondering what the Kirin Tor might teach a people who had kept hidden from them for thousands of years.", tags = { "faction:alliance" } },
        { "I began again {at}, a Windshaper seeking allies in the search for the wind spirits.", tags = { "faction:horde" } },
        { "I took up the road {at}, hoping our skysight might one day catch some trace of the spirits who first granted it.", tags = { "faction:horde" } },
        { "The Windshapers had always tended what the spirits left in our keeping, and I began again {at} in the same careful frame of mind.", tags = { "faction:horde" } },
        { "I set out {at}, with the failing pylons on my mind before anything else.", tags = { "home" } },
        { "I began again {at}, among a people grown used to doing without the spirits, and not yet used to doing without each other.", tags = { "home" } },
        { "I took up the road {at}, in a country that had never had to wonder what held it up.", tags = { "!home" } },
        { "I set out {at} with \"Gale's greetings\" ready for anyone I met, whether or not they knew what it meant.", tags = { "!home" } },
        { "I kept going {at}, in a world with more people in it than all of Zephras could hold, each of them someone I might yet come to know.", tags = { "!home" } },
        { "I continued {at} after dark, never fully at ease at that hour since Ban'aethal was lost in a single night.", tags = { "night" } },
        { "I set out {at}, with an islander's habit of trusting nothing to bear my weight until I had tested it." },
        { "I took up the road {at}, as unhurried as my Highborne forebears and, I hoped, rather less proud." },
        { "Work was wanting hands {at}, and I set out to lend mine." },
        { "I began again {at}, mindful that a people as few as mine could not spare a single life, least of all to carelessness.", tags = { "hc" } },
        { "Few people this side of the sky had ever met one of my kind, and I went about my business {at}, meaning to be a fair introduction to the rest of us.", tags = { "!home" } },
        { "Some among the Windshapers say the High Order's confidence has outrun its competence, and I set to work {at} meaning to close the gap from the competence side.", tags = { "faction:alliance" } },
        { "What the spirits once gave my people, we Windshapers count as a debt, and I went out {at} to pay back a little of it wherever I could.", tags = { "faction:horde" } },
        { "I moved on {at} after dark, keeping my pace to what my feet could vouch for rather than what my eyes could guess.", tags = { "night" } },
        { "With the skycutters no longer safe between the islands, whatever needed doing {at} fell to those of us already here, and I took my share of it.", tags = { "home" } },
        { "This world spends its plenty as if it could never run short, and I set out {at} still trying not to stare.", tags = { "!home" } },
        { "I got back to work {at}, with the habit of a people too few to leave any job for somebody else." },
        { "I went on {at} with a little of my rebel forebears' dislike of being told what could not be done." },
        { "I came to the work {at} the way one handles anything precious and failing at home, slowly and with both hands." },
        { "I set off {at} by daylight, glad of a light that comes back every morning without anyone needing to tend it.", tags = { "!night" } },
